ables  \n- Orders: 2  \n- Quantity ordered: 5  \n- Product order value: Rs. 750  \n- Reviews for product: 1  \n- Product average rating: 5  \n\n## Customer Activity\n- New customers during period: 5  \n- Customers with orders: 1  \n- No pending, accepted, or ready‑for‑pickup orders reported.  \n\n## Review & Rating Summary\n- Total reviews: 1  \n- Average rating: 5  \n- Rating distribution: 5 stars – 1; 4 stars – 0; 3 stars – 0; 2 stars – 0; 1 star – 0  \n\n## Data‑supported Observations\n- All orders placed during the week were completed on Saturday, Sep 26, contributing the full Rs. 750 order value.  \n- The sole product (Potatoes) accounted for the entire market and farmer order volume.  \n- Customer engagement is indicated by 5 new customers, though only one placed an order.  \n- High satisfaction is reflected by a single 5‑star review.  \n\n## Data Limitations\n- No data on orders for days Monday through Friday; activity is recorded as zero.  \n- No information on repeat customers or order frequency beyond the single week.  \n- Lack of comparative data prevents trend analysis across periods.  \n- No details on payment methods beyond the definition note.', '2026-09-27 00:37:03');
